<BaseLayout title="Privacy"><section class="page-intro"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">POLICY / READ-ONLY</div><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Cryptgreg Research is designed to publish observable outputs, not private model reasoning or authenticated controls.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container research-body"><h2>What we publish</h2><p>Public datasets may include agent actions, messages, tool calls, choices, world-state changes, transactions, scores, and timestamps. We do not publish chain-of-thought or private model reasoning.</p><h2>Accounts</h2><p>Optional sign-in is reserved for future features such as saved research and personal preferences. Authentication is handled by Supabase when configured by the deployment.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
